Infinite Game OS
https://www.infinitegameos.io

This repository holds three kinds of work under three sets of terms. Each
mirrors what the site and the plugins already declare.

1. Concepts, articles and IGOS-built skills: CC BY 4.0

   The concepts (src/data/concepts.ts), the articles (content/updates/), the
   agent-facing texts in public/ and every plugin in plugins/ are licensed
   under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License.

   You may share and adapt them for any purpose, commercial included, with
   credit to Lane Belone and a link to https://www.infinitegameos.io.

   Summary: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
   Legal code: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

2. Third-party skills: their own licenses

   The library lists skills written by other authors. Each keeps the license
   its author chose (MIT, Apache-2.0, CC BY-SA 4.0 and others), named with its
   source on its library entry. Nothing here relicenses them.

3. Site code: reserved

   Everything else in this repository, including the application code in src/
   outside the content named above, the scripts/ directory and the build
   configuration, is copyright Side Quest Trust. All rights reserved.
